.env
.env.*
**/*.log
**/logs

# Docs (not used at build time)
docs
**/*.md

# Test sources (containers build prod artifacts only)
**/test
**/__tests__
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
